ate": "2024-12-18T21:06:28Z"}, "message": "Remove the compiler flag from ocaml-compiler\n\nThe presence of the flag in both ocaml-base-compiler and ocaml-compiler\ncauses opam's invariant computation to produce a poor invariant:\n\ne.g. opam switch create 5.3.0~beta2 produced an invariant of\n  \"ocaml-base-compiler\" {= \"5.3.0~beta2\"} | \"ocaml-compiler\" {= \"5.3.0~beta2\"}\ninstead of the desired\n  \"ocaml-base-compiler\" {= \"5.3.0~beta2\"}", "tree": {"sha": "6b554fe0e69af26a4c1c825425a9b70d2f8d9155", "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/ocaml/opam-repository/git/trees/6b554fe0e69af26a4c1c825425a9b70d2f8d9155"}, "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/ocaml/opam-repository/git/commits/cd01c4f04b36d55ea02b0b4ed58defc05e832d4a", "comment_count": 0, "verification": {"verified": false, "reason": "unsigned", "signature": null, "payload": null, "verified_at": null}}, "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/ocaml/opam-repository/commits/cd01c4f04b36d55ea02b0b4ed58defc05e832d4a", "html_url": "https://github.com/ocaml/opam-repository/commit/cd01c4f04b36d55ea02b0b4ed58defc05e832d4a", "comments_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/ocaml/opam-repository/commits/cd01c4f04b36d55ea02b0b4ed58defc05e832d4a/comments", "author": {"login": "dra27", "id": 5250680, "node_id": "MDQ6VXNlcjUyNTA2ODA=", "avatar_url": "https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5250680?v=4", "gravatar_id": "", "url": "https://api.github.com/users/dra27", "html_url": "https://github.com/dra27", "followers_url": "https://api.github.com/users/dra27/followers", "following_url": "https://api.github.com/users/dra27/following{/other_user}", "gists_url": "https://api.github.com/users/dra27/gists{/gist_id}", "starred_url": "https://api.github.com/users/dra27/starred{/owner}{/repo}", "subscriptions_url": "https://api.github.com/users/dra27/subscriptions", "organizations_url": "https://api.github.com/users/dra27/orgs", "repos_url": "https://api.github.com/users/dra27/repos", "events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/dra2